    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n44 The Clayton is a stylish two-bedroom apartment situated in the iconic Gasworks development between Barrow Street and South Lotts Road in the heart of this vibrant neighbourhood. This first floor apartment, extending to c. 71 sq. m. provides bright spacious accommodation which is further complemented by the sunny balcony ideal for al fresco dining and a car parking space. The beautifully presented accommodation comprises of an entrance hall with storage cupboard, hot press and laundry cupboard and light filled living/dining room with a well-equipped kitchen located off. There are two double bedrooms (main en-suite) and family bathroom.The convenience of the location cannot be overstated benefiting from having every conceivable amenity both social and essential within walking distance. Some of these include local shopping on Barrow Street, Grand Canal Dock DART station and an excellent choice of restaurants and pubs such as Junior's, The Bath and Slattery's. Recreational amenities are well catered for with Shelbourne Park, the Aviva Stadium, the RDS and the Bord Gais Energy Theatre all within a short stroll."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nwith intercom, hot press, storage cupboard and utility cupboard with LG washer/dryer and wardrobe.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - \nwith windows and door to balcony.\n\nKitchen - \nwith range of fitted units, Zanussi electric oven, Zanussi electric hob, extractor fan, integrated Belling fridge/freezer, Kenwood dishwasher, tiled floor and stainless-steel sink.\n\nBedroom 1 - \ndouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes and window overlooking communal gardens.\n\nEn Suite - \nwith shower, wash hand basin, w.c., tiled floor and partly tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 2 - \ndouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes and window overlooking communal gardens.\n\nBathroom - \nwith bath, wash hand basin, w.c., tiled floor and partly tiled walls.\n\nBalcony - \nSouth-West facing balcony overlooking communal gardens with storage cupboard with gas boiler.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>First floor apartment</li><li>West facing balcony</li><li>Designated underground parking space</li><li>Presented in excellent condition</li><li>Gas fired central heating</ul>"
      },
